<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>Baltimore on the Prowl, 1952</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P&gt;The years following the 1948 Arab-Israeli war saw numerous attacks conducted by Palestinian terrorists.&amp;nbsp; This scenario assumes that, while&amp;nbsp;the American President had no intention of putting troops on the ground&amp;nbsp;to protect Israel&amp;nbsp;he was willing to commit naval forces to reduce the smuggling of arms in the Mediterranean.&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;-------------------------------------------------------&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;A delta template .ini file has been included in the .zip file to assist in updating the scenario to any future versions of the database.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;Scenario Author: Mark Gellis&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/P&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
